        "details": "YOU HAVE RECEIVED A FORM SUBMISSION. PLEASE REVIEW THE FORM DETAILS BELOW.\r\n\r\n\r\nFull Name Lacey Smith Phone +15597608520 How would you rate us? 2 - \u2b50\u2b50 (2 Star) How can we improve to serve you better? The woman\r\nwho brought us our food was very kind. This poor rating is not a reflection of her. I did tell her that the wings I was served\r\nwere cold. Like, very cold. She offered to have them remade but I don\u2019t want perfectly good food to go to waste so I told her I\r\nwould bring them home and heat them up myself. In an instance like this, I would expect for this item to be comped. I recognize I\r\ndid not purchase wings as a singular item, but I do think some sort of discount ought to have been given. To add insult to injury,\r\nthe pizza was not cooked all the way through. I was not the only one at our table with this feedback. Again, I recognize it\u2019s\r\nrestaurant week and y\u2019all\u2019s kitchen was probably pumping out more food than it usually does but I\u2019d be doing yall a disservice by\r\nnot mentioning it. Timezone America/New_York (GMT-05:00) Submission Date Mar 1st 2026, 9:36 am URL\r\nhttps://email.send.lcmsgsndr.com/c/eJxskUtr3DAQxz-NdavRWpLlPejQsA2U9EGhpcdFj3E8jaQxkuxt-unLhlIS2Os8_vx-M_6MwZyOP-a4fX_6otSHu88K7-DhyII5zk7DxMActB7ENKpRM0gW47k9r2CKvTDIOxbKCXIza6Gw-YaU2WIOc3DSTVZpC7MTXMHspZTBgT1KCZyhGfgwcsEPBy1GrvtRwKSF4ko4IYSTneQVcuijT_Wx5lB6T4lFs7S21k6874b7brgvsCNcar_Qahsl9DbShnXHGOG68H_knafcrG8s0ovzNLavp4_1z-_1m-KXcHr6-fCJJWgLBWNXZJkazujt1edcaSsezEwl1bedl0u8rrC10I4Biolgg6ecwTcqrJhfdrG5kzxAcc8BH7HZ2G-V_Qt_E9LMFfMmYzOe0vnmy3Yz_A0AAP__IlegpA",
