        "id": "ai-20-1",
        "content": "Louis Archuleta Jr. is a new client for Jahan Taila (Derby Digital). Grand Slam Pizza is a restaurant client. Jahan's strategy for Grand Slam Pizza includes generating cash flow through social media campaigns (Facebook, Instagram, Google Ads, Nextdoor). The email from March 12th indicates Jahan is proposing specific marketing campaigns to Louis. The forwarded email from March 9th regarding 'current subscription status' suggests Louis might be managing other services or subscriptions for Grand Slam Pizza, possibly related to a POS system (Arrow POS is mentioned). This could be an opportunity to integrate marketing with their existing tech stack or understand their current operational costs.",
