        "details": "Hi there,\r\n\r\nThank you for sharing this opportunity. I\u2019d love to be considered for the\r\nassistant role with a marketing focus; working hand in hand to build from\r\nscratch has always been my thing.\r\n\r\nI\u2019m a Digital Marketing Specialist with 8+ years of hands-on experience\r\nmanaging client fulfillment across Google Ads and Meta (Facebook &\r\nInstagram) campaigns, website builds, and overall marketing strategy. I\u2019ve\r\nworked closely with growing agencies and brands where speed,\r\naccountability, and performance really matter in the US and UK..\r\n\r\nMost recently, I worked with *Cloudeden (cloudofeden.com\r\n<http://cloudofeden.com>)*, a web development and marketing agency, in a\r\nvery similar capacity to what you\u2019re describing. There, I handled:\r\n\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   End-to-end *Google Ads and Facebook Ads* setup, optimization, and\r\n   reporting\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Building and optimizing *websites, funnels, and landing pages*\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Supporting brands with *marketing strategy, lead generation, and\r\n   performance optimization*\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Reviewing creatives, managing campaigns, and ensuring consistent results\r\n   across accounts\r\n\r\nOne of the notable brands I worked with during my agency experience was\r\n*ThisIsItBBQ.com*, where I supported paid advertising and digital marketing\r\nefforts to drive traffic, engagement, and conversions.\r\n\r\nBeyond Cloudeden, I\u2019ve managed paid ad campaigns and digital growth for\r\nboth *B2B and eCommerce brands*, consistently improving ROAS, lowering\r\nCPC/CPA, and generating qualified leads. I\u2019m very comfortable owning client\r\naccounts, optimizing campaigns daily, analyzing performance in GA4, and\r\nadjusting strategy based on data not guesswork.\r\n\r\nI\u2019ve attached my *resume* and *portfolio* for your review, and I\u2019d be happy\r\nto walk you through if needed.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to hearing from you.\r\nPortfolio: https://behance.net/emmanuelobioha\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n*Emmanuel Obioha*",
