        "details": "Subject: Private Dinner Gathering \u2013 November 22 at Daisy Dukes Caf\u00e9\r\n\r\nDear Lisa,\r\n\r\nThank you for reaching out and for considering Daisy Dukes Caf\u00e9 for your group dinner. We\u2019re happy to confirm availability on Saturday, November 22, 2025, at 7:00 PM for your group of 20 guests.\r\n\r\nOur private event space is located on the 2nd floor (stairs only) at Daisy Dukes Caf\u00e9, 308 St. Charles Avenue, New Orleans, LA 70130. The area is designed for buffet-style service to make dining and socializing easy and comfortable.\r\n\r\nYou can view our current buffet packages and menu options here:\r\n\ud83d\udc49 https://daisiesprivateevents.com/packages/\r\n\r\nSince your budget is around $35 per person, we\u2019ll be glad to or adjust selections to meet your group\u2019s preferences.\r\n\r\nPlease let us know if you\u2019d like\u00a0reserve the date for your group.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to hosting you and your colleagues for a relaxed evening after your conference.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,\r\nRobert Kagan\r\nDaisy Dukes Caf\u00e9\r\n308 St. Charles Ave.\r\nNew Orleans, LA 70130\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce7 daisydukesrestaurant@yahoo.com\r\n\r\n\r\n-Robert M Kagan Jr LLCDaisy Dukes/ Daisy Maes\r\n \r\n\r\n    On Sunday, October 26, 2025 at 09:53:09 PM CDT, Daisy Duke's Private Events <reservations@daisiesprivateevents.com> wrote:  \r\n \r\n \r\nHello Lisa Lin, \r\n\r\nThank you for reaching out!\u00a0 We\u2019ve received your inquiry regarding a private buffet-style event or catering order for delivery or pick-up at Daisy Dukes Caf\u00e9, located at 308 St. Charles Ave., 2nd Floor (stairs only). Our team will review your request and respond soon within 24 hours. Whether you\u2019re planning a private gathering overlooking the St. Charles Streetcar line or need our New Orleans favorites brought straight to you, we\u2019ll make it easy and delicious.\r\n\r\n\r\nWarm Regards,\r\n\r\nThe Daisy Dukes Events &amp; Catering Team\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you no longer wish to receive these emails you may unsubscribe",
