        "details": "Hi Jahan, How you doing? Thank you for sharing your email via DM. And I've\r\nreviewed the site you mentioned in your tweet and I can help you to build\r\nsomething like this.\r\n\r\nThese are the relevant websites built on WordPress:\r\n1- https://activetheory.net/  (A creative digital studio site focused on\r\nimmersive brand experiences. The website uses heavy motion design, 3D\r\ninteractions, and scroll based animations to tell stories. Animations feel\r\nintentional and cinematic react smoothly to user actions.)\r\n\r\n2- https://dogstudio.co/ (A design and branding agency website with a\r\nplayful yet premium feel. It uses micro-animations, smooth transitions and\r\ninteractive layouts to keep users engaged. The motion supports storytelling\r\nand brand personality without overwhelming the content.)\r\n\r\n3- https://motion.zajno.com/ (This is Zajno's motion showcase, focused on\r\nhigh-end UI animations, transitions and visual effects. The site highlights\r\nscroll animations, parallax and subtle interactions that make interfaces\r\nfeel polished and modern.)\r\n\r\n4- https://www.soapbox.us/ (A creative agency site built around bold\r\nvisuals and 3D motion. It uses WebGL-style animations, layered transitions,\r\nand dynamic scrolling to create an immersive, high-impact experience that\r\nfeels premium and futuristic.)\r\n\r\nIf it matches the style you're aiming I'd be happy to discuss more, Looking\r\nforward to hearing back from you. Have a good day",
