        "details": "We talked about setting the website up as one of our other owners did as in when someone puts in dates they would receive the prompt with the form to fill out for final pricing:\r\n\r\nCould you set it up like this:\r\n\r\nCONTACT HOST FORM\r\n\r\nName:\r\n\r\nDate of Stay:\r\n\r\nPhone:\r\n\r\nEmail:\r\n\r\nMessage:\r\n\r\n#Adults\r\n\r\n#Children under 18\r\n\r\nPet?\r\n\r\nIf yes, type of pet\r\n\r\nThis is an ESTIMATE ONLY.  Please submit this form and contact information and contact host for final pricing\r\n\r\nThank You,\r\n\r\nMichelle Richardson\r\nRichardson Properties, Inc.\r\nDavid Richardson Builder, Inc.",
