        "details": "Here is there pricing that I have come up with:\r\n\r\nBlue Surf 15A and 16A (1 bedroom units)\r\n\r\nMarch 1st - May 22nd  - Base rate $199/ night\r\n\r\nMay 23rd - August 14th  - Base rate $269/ night\r\n\r\nAugust 15th - October 23rd - Base rate $199/night\r\n\r\nOctober 24th - December 31st - Base rate $149/night\r\n\r\nJanuary 1st - February 28th 2027 - Base rate $179/night\r\n\r\nIf a booking is 7+ days, apply a 15% discount to the nightly rate ONLY\r\n\r\nCleaning fee - $200 + tax\r\n\r\nPet fee - $100 + tax\r\n\r\nTax -  as you had it set up already\r\n\r\n______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\r\n\r\nBlue Surf 5, 6, 7, 15B, 16B and 22  (2 bedroom units)\r\n\r\nMarch 1st - May 22nd - Base rate $259/night\r\n\r\nMay 23rd - August 14th - Base rate $389/night\r\n\r\nAugust 15th - October 23rd - Base rate $259/night\r\n\r\nOctober 24th - December 31st - Base rate $199/night\r\n\r\nJanuary 1st - February 28th - Base rate $199/night\r\n\r\nIf a booking is 7+ days, apply a 14.2% discount to the nightly rate ONLY\r\n\r\nCleaning fee - $200 + tax\r\n\r\nPet fee - $100 + tax\r\n\r\nTax - as you had it set up already\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nThank You,\r\n\r\nMichelle Richardson\r\nRichardson Properties, Inc.\r\nDavid Richardson Builder, Inc.",
