        "summary": "Podcast Invitation",
        "subject": "Podcast Invitation",
        "details": "Hi Jahan, my colleague Gee found you on LinkedIn while looking for key voices in the marketing & advertising space and recommended I reach out.\r\n\r\nWe're launching one of our first podcast episodes featuring leaders in marketing & advertising, and we thought you'd be a great fit.\r\n\r\nOn the show, we'd love to dive into **Rethinking Sales Forecasting: A Fresh Approach to Accuracy**.\r\n\r\nAside from being a fun conversation, it could be a nice chance for some positive visibility.\r\n\r\nWould you mind if I share a bit more info?\r\n\r\nHave a nice day!\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n\r\nAryan Virk\r\nFounder | Aryan Virk Agency\r\n\r\nIMPORTANT NOTICE: This e-mail may contain privileged or confidential information and is intended only for the use of the person to whom it is addressed.\r\n\r\n------- Forwarded Message -------\r\nFrom: Gee Lau\r\nSent: Sep 7, 2025, 4:23 PM\r\nTo: Aryan Virk\r\nSubject: Reach out to Jahan \u2013 podcast\r\n\r\n\r\nAryan, I was searching for possible guests for the podcast and came across Jahan from DerbyDigital. This looks like someone who'd add real value. Definitely worth reaching out!\r\n\r\n\r\nGee Lau\r\nCo-Founder of Aryan Virk Agency",
