        "details": "Bob- the older man lost over 60lbs and is in the best shape of his life. He\r\nstarted coming to SS in may of 2024 and became our first client to hit 500\r\nclasses in just 15 months.\r\n\r\nLuis- the other guy spent just 2 weeks climbing 3 times a week and taking\r\nxformer 2x and these were his results.\r\n\r\nLexie- girl in bikini got these results just in a few months of being an\r\nunlimited member\r\n\r\nme- this change happened due to adding the versaclimber into my already\r\nconsistent Xformer workouts.\r\n\r\nI have more and will send them as they come in.",
