        "subject": "Marketing & Administrative VA \u2013 Full-Time",
        "details": "Hi Jahan,\r\n\r\nHope you\u2019re doing well.\r\n\r\nI\u2019m reaching out to apply for the *Marketing & Administrative VA\r\n(Full-Time)* role at Derby Digital. I have *9+ years of hands-on digital\r\nmarketing experience* and have worked closely with founders and small\r\nagency teams, supporting both *marketing execution and day-to-day\r\noperations*.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s where I can add value immediately:\r\n\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   *Google Ads & Meta Ads:* Campaign setup, optimization, reporting, and\r\n   ongoing support\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   *GoHighLevel:* Funnel setup, pipelines, automations, lead management,\r\n   and CRM hygiene\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   *WordPress:* Basic site updates, landing pages, forms, and integrations\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   *Marketing support:* Research, competitor analysis, lead prep, and light\r\n   creative coordination\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   *Admin support:* Email handling, scheduling, documentation, and task\r\n   management\r\n\r\nI\u2019m comfortable working *full-time in U.S. (EST) business hours*,\r\ncommunicate clearly in English, and work independently without needing\r\nconstant direction. I\u2019ve supported multiple clients and internal teams at\r\nonce, so staying organized and dependable is second nature to me.\r\n\r\nWhat stood out about Derby Digital is the opportunity to work directly with\r\nthe founder and grow alongside the agency. I enjoy fast-moving environments\r\nwhere performance is rewarded and responsibilities expand as trust is built.\r\n\r\nI\u2019ve attached my *resume* and can share *past ad results and relevant work\r\nexamples* upon request. I\u2019m available to start immediately.\r\n\r\nLooking forward to connecting.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\n*Wasil Abdal*\r\nDigital Marketing & Operations\r\nabdalbukharii@gmail.com\r\nhttps://www.linkedin.com/in/wasil-abdal/",
