        "details": "Hi Jahan\r\n\r\nJust wanted to let you know that your article is now live on Bold Journey!\r\n\r\nHere's the link:\r\nhttps://boldjourney.com/meet-jahan-taila\r\n\r\nOn the site, you can find it on the homepage in an article titled:\r\nThe Power of Persistence: Overcoming Haters and Doubters\r\n\r\nCongratulations!  It was great working together again and looking forward\r\nto many more collaborations to come.\r\n\r\nWe'd love to send you editorial-style prints of your article if you are\r\ninterested.\r\n\r\nThe cost is $17 for the first print and $5/each for additional copies.  We\r\nalso have discounted pricing if you are interested in 50 or more prints.\r\nSamples are attached below, you can let me know if you are interested.\r\n\r\n BoldJourney Print Samples.pdf\r\n<https://drive.google.com/open?id=1UYnZEx9Y1fCrenqAEHaBlECYiV8GqrRs>\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks,\r\nMike",
