        "date": "Sat, 8 Nov",
        "summary": "New menu",
        "subject": "New menu",
        "details": "Hey Jahan,\r\n\r\n\r\nWe really like the new menu layout! it\u2019s looking great. We just need the\r\ndescriptions to be a little more legible and a few small corrections made.\r\nWe printed out some test copies, but we\u2019ll need an updated version once\r\nthese are fixed.\r\n\r\n\r\nMenu Corrections:\r\n\r\n\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Make the description font bigger for better readability\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Capitalize all sauces\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Correct spelling of Bleu Cheese\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Change House Sauce to Station Sauce (or something similar)\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Add Side Salad to Sides\r\n\r\n\r\nStarters:\r\n\r\n\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Change \u201cSpicy Ranch\u201d to \u201cJalape\u00f1o Ranch\u201d\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Capitalize \u201cSmoky Ketchup\u201d\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Add the word mozzarella to cheese in Eggrolls\r\n\r\n\r\nSalads:\r\n\r\n\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Correct Caesar spelling\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Add Pork as an option\r\n\r\n\r\nMain Courses:\r\n\r\n\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Revise descriptions overall\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Half Chicken \u2013 remove \u201cA\u201d at the start, capitalize Bourbon BBQ, and say\r\n   \u201cserved with your choice of 2 sides\u201d\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Tenders \u2013 should read \u201cwith a sauce of your choice\u201d (not \u201cwith a side of\r\n   sauce\u201d)\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Chicken & Waffles \u2013 remove \u201c(s)\u201d from waffles; say \u201ctopped with maple\r\n   syrup\u201d (not \u201c& maple syrup\u201d)\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Platter \u2013 should say House-Smoked Chicken and \u201cserved with your choice\r\n   of 2 sides\u201d\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Meatloaf \u2013 should read Smoky Ketchup Glaze\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Fish \u2013 specify the type (Swai, Vietnamese Catfish, etc.)\r\n\r\n\r\nSandwiches:\r\n\r\n\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Station Burger \u2013 change \u201c2 juice\u201d to \u201c2 juicy\u201d; onions are not bourbon\r\n   onions; capitalize B in Brioche\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Vegan Burger \u2013 not house-made; remove aioli and replace with Smoky\r\n   Ketchup\r\n\r\n\r\nAlso, please remove \u201chouse-made\u201d from all dressings.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks, man \u2014 once you update it, send back the final version so we can get\r\nnew prints made.\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2014 Kendell",
