        "subject": "A and C it is",
        "details": "We are doing it.\r\n\r\nOver the next few days, I'll be sharing how we got the literal best clients in the world (Nike, Tony Robbins, Brian Tracy, etc.).\r\n\r\nAnd I'll combine it with strategies that will help you scale your company in a way that's actually exponential while doing less work.\r\n\r\nYour first lesson starts now.\r\n\r\nLesson 1: Only use billionaire tactics to solve your current problems.\r\n\r\nAnd today we'll start with setting your big goal.\r\n\r\n**Not** because it will help your mindset, not because it's what millionaire self-help gurus tell you to do, and definitely not to impress your friends or family.\r\n\r\nSo what is the reason?\r\n\r\nLet me answer this by asking you a simple question:\r\n\r\nWhat did Facebook, Amazon, PayPal, etc. have in common when they were built?\r\n\r\nExactly.\r\n\r\nThey had a team of people willing to work for free on the business in exchange for a future payoff.\r\n\r\nAnd why would people want to work for free?\r\n\r\nWell, because in exchange they get a future pay off.\u00a0\r\n\r\nThat future pay off might be a percentage in your company or a percentage on the revenue you\u2019ll soon bring in. \r\n\r\nBut whatever it is. It has to be big if you want to attract A players.\r\n\r\nAnd you need A players because it will save you a lot of headache.\u00a0\r\n\r\nA players are like special force operators who can read your mind without you even saying a word.\r\n\r\nThat's the most important reason for you to set a big goal.\r\n\r\nBut why would you ever want to give up a percentage of your company?\u00a0\r\n\r\nFirst of all whatever you\u2019re doing it's clearly not working for you right now (or at least you\u2019re not growing at at the speed that you could be moving at.\r\n\r\nAsk yourself this.\u00a0\r\n\r\nWould I rather own 60% of $1 million per month or 100% of $50k/mo?\r\n\r\nWith the 1M per month you have to spend 7-12 days building your team and with the 50k/mo you\u2019ll be working non stop while burning yourself out over a period of 3-12 months.\r\n\r\nThis is right in front of you right now. Less than 7 days away.\u00a0\r\n\r\nI usually do it in 4\u20135 days but realistically most people with no business experience take 10\u201312 days to get it done.\r\n\r\nTomorrow or Thursday, I'll go into the actual tangible steps\u2014including using AI to hand-select the best candidates and how to protect yourself while doing it.\r\n\r\nTo your success,\r\n\r\nGet ready. Don't slack. And get after it.\r\n\r\nColin\r\n\r\nhttps://www.instagram.com/colin.dingelstad/reels/ \r\n\r\nMentors of Mentors, Meestersweg 6, 6071BN Swalmen, The Netherlands\r\nNo longer interested in using viral videos to build your influence?\r\nYou can unsubscribe http://mentorsofmentors.activehosted.com/proc.php?c=213&m=336&s=55f4bee756905bca3072c420f5c40527&d=22062&v=2&nl=6&act=unsub to stop receiving these emails.\r\n\r\nhttps://mentorsofmentors.store/2-step-system-new-years-discount",
