        "subject": "Cindy Lawrence from Oxmoor Ford",
        "details": "Hi Jahan! I'm Cindy Lawrence, your remote sales assistant at Oxmoor Ford. I see your request from yesterday about checking vehicle availability. I'll connect with one of our sales consultants to confirm the status for you right away. Have you looked at any other vehicles that caught your interest? Let me know if you have any specific features or options you're looking for!\r\n\r\n\r\nRespectfully, \r\nCindy Lawrence\r\n Oxmoor Ford",
