        "date": "Wed, 29 Ja",
        "summary": "Helcim/Switch From Stripe",
        "subject": "Helcim/Switch From Stripe",
        "details": "Hello Jahan,\r\n\r\nThanks for reaching out to us in regards to possibly switching from Stripe.\r\nSomething we find helpful is a breakdown on how we compare to Stripe,\r\nplease view using this link: Stripe Comparison & Switching Guide\r\n<https://d2bcd604.na1.hs-sales-engage.com/Ctc/L0+23284/d2BcD604/Jl22-6qcW7lCdLW6lZ3m5W2vQ01j9j2v9pW3d577Z3J50cWW5PrTd42JHgYwN1zSx-H9Gfc6W6sKhJq32hjCjW6tW55S1vGBrLW2CmDGl7Xw9XzW8f8vZJ6-6YY-VYhgxh8WC9S2VvDh0j4nJcZlW7CLw6T6ZpD6YW4Lww3g3NX2c8W4vmZny5pD1z4W6FsxfT3bBGz9W83vtCr5WDz4FN2g1RYh5Tgv-W17BXFx2QNmTnN6-7_35WGcmCW6pZ9v75CvWgyW3L2nXl8-46RfV4rk2v4skngBW52J2bN19n008W3cXsW_5LyqL0W1JXz2G2yWvw5f6nrxcq04>\r\n\r\nAt Helcim, we use the Interchange Plus pricing model, it allows our\r\nmerchants access to transparent and lowest rates possible.\r\n\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   The reason why it is variable is because we're giving the best possible\r\n   rate for each type of transaction contrary to flat rates which oftentimes\r\n   you\u2019ll end up paying for higher rates regardless of what and how much you\r\n   process.\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   For our service, we only charge a set margin on top of the transaction\r\n   at *0.40% + 8\u00a2 for in person/0.50% + 25\u00a2 for keyed transactions*, which\r\n   decreases as you process more, enabling you to save on costs and get better\r\n   leverage for your business.\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   You only pay for what you process. It's transparent, fair, and simple.\r\n\r\nIf you goto our pricing page here\r\n<https://d2bcd604.na1.hs-sales-engage.com/Ctc/L0+23284/d2BcD604/JkM2-6qcW6N1vHY6lZ3lzW1-pxGM4h1gq1W5P1PgF7PjtJ5W1w2qsl8lVqCYW7q2Gg-7zMzDbW3k1-BK50hnyRN77j-WcvP3cwW66QPdM2xlSgtW6f7jqG1zRQPNW81l9jx25j8C-N3nS_t6WbjpKW1cdHW81wNGM0W5VlL4K529lhRW6T0kXc2M95j-W5-pGPW15LY0GW7HjQ-55CN0V8W78Q3V747VgzWW8YWHdg115fl5W4V_yp_5WW7y2W5fMZbf8LzDSZW2Wd1904sGsfjVDqs_H4Mbm9PW8pLn2Q8jMJqzdcZFWC04>\r\nyou'll be able to explore the averages and true rates of card types.\r\n\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   We do offer volume discounts based on your monthly processing.\r\n\r\nPlease see the following information below.\r\n\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   0.50% + $0.25 for ACH but those fees are capped at $6\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   No monthly Fee\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   PCI program included - No PCI Fees!\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   No setup fee or application fees\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   No statement fees, admin fees, deposit fees or monthly minimums\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   No contract or cancelation fees\r\n   -\r\n\r\n   Transactions are batched out nightly and generally funded within 1-2\r\n   business days.\r\n\r\nWhen signing up with us our merchants have access to Helcim's All-In-One\r\nPlatform allows you to gain better leverage in operating your business. It\r\nlets you accept payments both in-store\r\n<https://d2bcd604.na1.hs-sales-engage.com/Ctc/L0+23284/d2BcD604/JkM2-6qcW6N1vHY6lZ3p4W78-fg04KByKCW3RcwGp2QGT1-W60vL684SXBHrW1lkNrh1hTBZFW30QXlt1h4kNRW1_dpGg55P4VVW48B8xr23sfrDW3mx0zP7VF6bMW8fZlvn8QDR6-W3sJj3P7MKcSlW83_yWc9lVRTPVdnSSF6n8ZcLW8_tv2r2KvTFzW38BcY81kL3RRW7Zr6Nh9bMMRnW2p0vBQ1qCKgXW4SMW8_598tR5W7xQnTj6-8zyqW250XY37ZzSz3W1cXfgJ7lt1z0W6WChf078T3JfW8q8fDz90d--Df49wR5P04>\r\nand online, build your invoices\r\n<h",
